    {
      "id": "lM4j8D6aIza2RwVHXv88s",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 815.6657877747439,
      "y": 804.828078835925,
      "width": 866.0018235220812,
      "height": 189.4392032845007,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 80,
      "groupIds": [
        "257dN2NDmF9nx6aHmvv6C"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3S",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 137476332,
      "version": 1106,
      "versionNonce": 2075591148,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786280940475,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. why discarding milp's output action model - its rules state that hol[t] ≥ steppre, thus the\nmodel can put steppre=0 for \"easy satisfaction\", leading to no preconditions at all (in the\nrosame mechanism, their ג param pushes predicates to be preconditions to avoid that)\n\n2. with that many trajectories (3-6, with ~15 transitions each) we may do it in one pass.\nif not - we could perform a loop rosame-style, choosing different subsets of trajectories for\neach round, feeding the resulted pisam-based action model as the soft action model to the \nnext iteration of the milp.",
      "fontSize": 18.943920328450073,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. why discarding milp's output action model - its rules state that hol[t] ≥ steppre, thus the model can put steppre=0 for \"easy satisfaction\", leading to no preconditions at all (in the rosame mechanism, their ג param pushes predicates to be preconditions to avoid that)\n\n2. with that many trajectories (3-6, with ~15 transitions each) we may do it in one pass.\nif not - we could perform a loop rosame-style, choosing different subsets of trajectories for \neach round, feeding the resulted pisam-based action model as the soft action model to the \nnext iteration of the milp.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
